{"suttaId":"tha-ap316","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[9276,9294],"vripara":"14"},"segments":{"tha-ap316:0.3":"Sattapadumiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap316:1.1":"“Nadīkūle vasāmahaṃ, nesādo nāma brāhmaṇo;","tha-ap316:1.3":"Satapattehi pupphehi, sammajjitvāna assamaṃ.","tha-ap316:2.1":"“Suvaṇṇavaṇṇaṃ sambuddhaṃ, siddhatthaṃ lokanāyakaṃ;","tha-ap316:2.3":"Disvā nabhena [vanena (syā. ka.)] gacchantaṃ, hāso me udapajjatha.","tha-ap316:3.1":"“Paccuggantvāna sambuddhaṃ, lokajeṭṭhaṃ narāsabhaṃ;","tha-ap316:3.3":"Assamaṃ atināmetvā, jalajaggehi okiriṃ.","tha-ap316:4.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap316:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap316:5.1":"“Ito te sattame kappe, caturo pādapāvarā;","tha-ap316:5.3":"Sattaratanasampannā, cakkavattī mahabbalā.","tha-ap316:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap316:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā sattapadumiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap316:8.1":"Sattapadumiyattherassāpadānaṃ catutthaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3270,"to":3270,"paras":[{"para":3270,"vripara":"16","refs":["tha-ap316:3"],"lines":["Catutthāpadāne <b>jalajaggehi okirin</b>ti jalajehi uttamehi uppalapadumādīhi pupphehi okiriṃ pūjesinti attho."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap316:3"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap316:3.3","jalajaggehi okiriṃ",0,0]]},"tika":null}
